Third-party components
================================================================================

This product includes components derived from StarlightGUI
(https://github.com/OpenStarlight/StarlightGUI), Copyright (c) StarlightGUI
contributors (author "Stars"), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

1. Sirius.sys
   A prebuilt Windows kernel driver binary (original location:
   StarlightGUI/Assets/Sirius.sys). Redistributed unmodified in Object form
   under Apache-2.0 §3. PGS loads it via the Service Control Manager and
   communicates through its existing IOCTL contract.

2. SiriusIO.h
   The Sirius driver IOCTL/structure definitions (modules/ppl/SiriusIO.h).
   Adapted for MinGW-w64: MSVC-specific `#pragma warning` directives are
   wrapped under `_MSC_VER`. No protocol definitions were changed.

3. SiriusDriverClient.h
   The driver client logic (modules/ppl/SiriusDriverClient.h) is derived from
   StarlightGUI's DriverUtils::LoadKernelDriver and
   KernelInstance::GetDriverDevice / SetPPL / SiQueryProcessInformation.

Per Apache-2.0 §4(b), the following PGS source files were modified to add
module-system support and are marked accordingly in their headers/comments:
  - include/Process_Guard/PGS.h
  - src/service/PGS.cpp
  - tools/pgs_bless.cpp
  - tools/build_pgs.bat
  - tools/build_pgs.sh

